<aside class="arrival"><strong>One detail to settle before booking</strong><p>A lockbox does not guarantee unrestricted overnight access. Neither baseline listing explicitly confirms after-midnight arrival. Check the latest permitted arrival time and building access instructions.</p></aside>
<div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / ALTERNATIVE & EXCLUSION</p><h2>The alternatives.</h2></div><p>Lower prices, with different tradeoffs.</p></div>
<div class="alternatives"><article class="alternative"><figure><img src="/assets/toronto/stays/1415761852010323786.jpg" alt="Interior shown on the Luxury Spacious Downtown Toronto Condo listing" width="720" height="480" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Listing photo · Airbnb listing linked below</figcaption></figure><p class="eyebrow">RETURN STAY · 13–21 NOV</p><h3>Luxury Spacious Downtown Toronto Condo</h3><p class="area">Parkdale / Queen West at Dufferin area · public map location</p><p class="walk"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;origin=43.6419,-79.429&amp;destination=49+Spadina+Avenue+Toronto&amp;travelmode=walking" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">≈ 43 min · 3.1 km to 49 Spadina ↗</a></p><p class="alt-price">€841.73 <span>fresh checkout total · 8 nights</span></p><p>A dedicated workspace, kitchen, and free in-unit washer and dryer. Rated 4.94 from 17 reviews. A strong value option for in-unit laundry.</p><p><strong>Check first:</strong> check-in after 15:00, but self-check-in and late access remain unconfirmed. Request to book; host has 24 hours to accept. Full refund before 30 October at 16:00 Toronto time; 50% of each night back before 6 November at 15:00, with no service-fee refund. Nonrefundable thereafter.</p><p class="quote">Checkout and amenities freshly checked 18 October 2026. €943.12 accommodation − €235.78 weekly discount + €134.39 taxes.</p><a href="https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1415761852010323786" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View condo ↗</a></article><article class="alternative"><p class="eyebrow">FIRST STAY · 28 OCT–9 NOV</p><h3>Great location 1BR basement</h3><p class="area">Neighbourhood not confirmed</p><p class="alt-price">€934 <span>earlier search-only price · 12 nights</span></p><p>Workspace listed; paid shared laundry on request. Rated 4.95 from 56 reviews.</p><p><strong>Important tradeoff:</strong> check-in ends at 23:00. Unsuitable for the 22:05 landing unless later access is explicitly arranged. Kitchen details, final price and cancellation have not been verified.</p><p class="quote">Search observation from earlier on 18 October 2026. Availability not rechecked.</p><a href="https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/22355676" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View basement apartment ↗</a></article></div>
<section class="decision"><p class="eyebrow">04 / THE CALL</p><h2>Choose the commute,<br>then settle late access.</h2><p><strong>For work proximity:</strong> Stay Steps (€1,637.32) + the 35th Floor Suite (€1,244.27) totals €2,881.59, with dedicated workspaces and roughly 8–9-minute walks. This is the strongest provisional pairing for the new brief, subject to confirmed late access. The first listing has no verified self-check-in; the return suite lists a lockbox.</p><p><strong>For value:</strong> the west-end apartment + the Parkdale condo totals €2,282.31, saving €599.28 against that closer pair and adding free in-unit laundry for the return. The west-end public map area is about 63 minutes / 4.7 km on foot from 49 Spadina, so it trades proximity for price. The Parkdale public map areas are about 42–43 minutes / 3.1 km on foot. The original Parkdale return option brings a later free-cancellation deadline. No option is booked.</p><div class="checks"><span><b>01</b> Confirm late access</span><span><b>02</b> Recheck final totals</span><span><b>03</b> Review cancellation</span></div></section>
